@startuml Fluxo de Moderação de Causas
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  Fluxo de Moderação de Causas
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #BDBDBD
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowThickness 1.5
  ArrowColor #555555
  LifeLineBorderColor #CCCCCC
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  GroupBorderColor #7B1FA2
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
  DividerBorderColor #CCCCCC
}

title **Fluxo de Moderação de Causas**

actor "👤 Autor" as U
actor "🛡 Admin" as A
participant "⚡ API" as API #E3F2FD
participant "☁️ S3\nStorage" as S3 #FFF9C4
database "🐘 PostgreSQL" as DB #E8EAF6
queue "📨 Email\nQueue" as Q #FFEBEE

== 1. Criação da causa ==

U -> API : POST /causes\n{ title, description, images[] }
activate API
API -> S3 : Upload imagens
S3 --> API : imageKeys[]
API -> DB : Cria Cause (status: ACTIVE)
API --> U : causa criada
deactivate API

== 2. Envio de documentos ==

U -> API : POST /causes/:id/documents\n{ file, docType }
activate API
API -> S3 : Upload documento
S3 --> API : fileKey
API -> DB : Cria CauseDocument\n(status: PENDING)
API -> Q : 📧 "Causa em análise"
API --> U : documento anexado
deactivate API

== 3. Revisão pelo admin ==

A -> API : GET /causes/admin/pending
activate API
API -> DB : Lista causas pendentes
API --> A : causas[]
deactivate API

A -> API : PATCH /causes/admin/documents/:docId/review\n{ status: "APPROVED" }
activate API
API -> DB : Atualiza CauseDocument
API --> A : ok
deactivate API

== 4. Moderação final ==

A -> API : PATCH /causes/admin/:id/moderate\n{ status: "ACTIVE", isVerified: true }
activate API
API -> DB : Atualiza Cause\n(isVerified = true)
API -> Q : 📧 "Causa aprovada!"
API --> A : causa moderada
deactivate API

Q --> U : 📧 Notificação por email

@enduml
